.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqopv 1 "February 2025" "sqopv 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqopv \- An implementation of the verification\-only subset of the Stateless OpenPGP Command Line Interface using sqopv 0.38.0
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqopv\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
An implementation of the verification\-only subset of the Stateless OpenPGP Command Line Interface using sqopv 0.38.0
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sqopv\-version(1)
Prints version information
.TP
sqopv\-verify(1)
Verifies Detached Signatures
.TP
sqopv\-inline\-verify(1)
Verifies Inline\-Signed Messages
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.38.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
Sequoia PGP
